        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 311.85,
          "end": 314.67,
          "en": "Now here you see that I'm currently getting an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 314.67,
          "end": 316.92,
          "en": "though, and the error I do get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 316.92,
          "end": 319.8,
          "en": "is that my Iterable thing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 319.8,
          "end": 323.79,
          "en": "can't be assigned to a parameter of type List.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 323.79,
          "end": 325.05,
          "en": "And I get this error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 325.05,
          "end": 327.24,
          "en": "because map actually returns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 327.24,
          "end": 329.812,
          "en": "a so-called Iterable object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 329.812,
          "end": 333.33,
          "en": "which is almost the same as a list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 333.33,
          "end": 335.52,
          "en": "but not entirely the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 335.52,
          "end": 338.19,
          "en": "And this is just some internal thing in Dart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 338.19,
          "end": 340.77,
          "en": "but thankfully, such an Iterable object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 340.77,
          "end": 343.68,
          "en": "can easily be converted to a list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 343.68,
          "end": 346.953,
          "en": "by calling toList here at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 348,
          "end": 353,
          "en": "So we chain the toList method after calling map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 353.73,
          "end": 355.83,
          "en": "So on the result produced by map,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 355.83,
          "end": 358.563,
          "en": "which is this Iterable object, we call toList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
