          "end": 364.2,
          "en": "And now here we generate a list of rows.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 364.2,
          "end": 366.06,
          "en": "And in every row,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 366.06,
          "end": 369.003,
          "en": "I then wanna output various pieces of information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 369.93,
          "end": 372.84,
          "en": "For example, the index of the question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 372.84,
          "end": 375.33,
          "en": "for which we're outputting data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 375.33,
          "end": 377.52,
          "en": "And here we can start quite simple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 377.52,
          "end": 380.61,
          "en": "and simply output a Text widget for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
